From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:20:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Align caption margin adjustments for Taffy's tagged pointers

A caption margin adjustment is handed to Taffy as a calc() pointer, and Taffy's CompactLength keeps its tag in the pointer's low three bits. On wasm32 the struct only asked for 4-byte alignment, which held only because dlmalloc rounds every chunk to 8; an allocator that honours the requested alignment failed Taffy's assertion and panicked during table layout.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
 src/layout/evict.rs | 116 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 src/layout/table.rs |   3 ++
 2 files changed, 75 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

